&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Growth Network Director, you will hold one of the most senior and consequential commercial roles within WPP Enterprise Solutions. You will be responsible for turning the most valuable market signals, client relationships, and WPP network intelligence into high-quality, strategically shaped growth opportunities and for creating the momentum that moves them from first conversation to qualified pursuit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at the intersection of consultative selling, transformation strategy, and executive relationship management, you will bring a rare combination of commercial instinct and intellectual rigour. You do not wait for a brief to arrive fully formed. You identify signals others miss, impose strategic clarity where ambiguity exists, shape the opportunity narrative before the client has fully articulated the need, and mobilise the right combination of WPP expertise around a live, credible commercial path. This is enterprise growth leadership in its most active and most demanding form.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working fluidly across WPP Network Growth, you will engage at the highest levels of the organisation and the market, operating credibly alongside Global Client Leads, agency CEOs, senior client stakeholders, consulting and technology partners, and ES capability heads. Your effectiveness will be measured not by the volume of relationships you manage, but by the quality of the opportunities you originate, the rigour with which you qualify and shape them, and your ability to connect the right people, at the right moment, around the right commercial proposition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Generate:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and progress high-value opportunities across existing WPP relationships, direct enterprise demand, senior stakeholder networks and strategic market signals, converting early intelligence into commercially viable pursuits before the opportunity has fully formed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build genuine, durable trust at the highest levels with Global Client Leads, agency leaders, WPP Media, WPP Creative, WPP Open, consulting and alliance partners, and senior client stakeholders, creating the access and relationships that sustain commercial momentum over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess each live opportunity with commercial discipline and strategic clarity, evaluating client need, ES relevance, revenue potential, urgency, stakeholder access, winnability and the required path to activation so that the team&#39;s energy is concentrated where it matters most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Shape:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate ambiguous client problems into a clear, compelling Enterprise Solutions opportunity narrative, spanning CRM, commerce, CX, content, data, AI, platforms, marketing technology, managed services and operating model transformation, making the complex feel navigable and the case for action feel urgent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the pursuit strategy for priority opportunities from end to end; owning problem framing, stakeholder mapping, commercial logic, solution direction, proof points and activation needs and carry that strategy through to a result&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know exactly when and how to bring in solution, commercial, technical, delivery, alliance and subject-matter expertise, assembling the right combination of people at the right point in the opportunity lifecycle, not before they add value and not after the moment has passed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activate &amp;amp; Lead:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear, decisive leadership readouts on priority opportunities, covering blockers, decision points, commercial potential, next actions and escalation needs and ensuring senior stakeholders always have an accurate, current picture of where the most important pursuits stand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define how WPP Enterprise Solutions shows up to the network and to enterprise clients as a credible transformation and growth partner, contributing not just to individual opportunities but to the commercial infrastructure and positioning that makes future growth possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a high bar for MD and Group Director colleagues across opportunity quality, client readiness, strategic thinking and commercial discipline, multiplying your impact well beyond your own pipeline and raising the performance of the team around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an executive-level growth leader with a demonstrated record of creating and converting large enterprise opportunities, not inheriting them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate with credibility in complex matrix environments, moving fluently across consulting, technology, agency, platform, media, creative and client leadership groups, adapting your register without losing your point of view&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are commercially sharp and consultative in equal measure, equally comfortable shaping a transformation strategy at the outset and driving the commercial execution that turns it into a win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your executive presence is substantive, not performative. You can simplify complex transformation topics for senior client and internal audiences without losing the depth that makes your perspective worth having&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an entrepreneurial operator, capable of building a new growth motion from the ground up while advancing live opportunities that cannot wait for the infrastructure to be in place&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You typically bring 15 or more years of experience across enterprise growth, transformation consulting, technology consulting, digital transformation, marketing transformation, integrated agency leadership, strategic sales or complex client leadership, with a career that has consistently placed you in rooms where large, complex decisions were being made&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked directly with C-suite and senior enterprise stakeholders across marketing, technology, customer, operations, data, AI, commerce and transformation agendas and with enough regularity that it is your natural operating environment, not an occasional stretch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your background may have been built inside a consulting firm, systems integrator, technology business, digital transformation firm, large agency network, media network, WPP operating company or enterprise sales organisation. The path matters less than what it gave you: commercial depth, network credibility and the strategic range to operate at the level this role demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have direct experience shaping large pursuits, managing strategic accounts, navigating multi-market opportunities, driving partner-led growth or leading multi-capability transformation programmes, and you understand the difference between being close to those efforts and being accountable for them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold yourself and others to a high standard across revenue accountability, pipeline discipline, complex stakeholder management and opportunity qualification, not as processes you follow, but as disciplines that define how you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial, driven, and accomplished Strategic Account Sales Director, focused on developing and executing an enterprise growth strategy across EMEA, in partnership with a global sales team devoted to our largest global client relationships in the Financial Services market. This role is responsible for hiring, managing and developing the Strategic AEs in EMEA that will be selling to our Strategic Clients across the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant sales experience with a B2B SaaS solutions and a customer network in the Financial Services market (buy side and sell side). 5+ years of prior management experience. You understand the nuances of the EMEA market for Financial Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leader. You are someone who inspires confidence and motivates both internal teams and clients to drive towards common goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of exceeding sales targets as a seller, and a proven track record of managing teams that exceed sales targets; we maintain a team of top sales performers and a great winning culture. Reputation for consistently delivering results and setting the example for work ethic, initiative, enthusiasm, and commitment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent at building C Level and Senior business relationships with clients. You build trust and credibility with key stakeholders, decision-makers and influencers and are focused on creating long term partnerships with the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Consultative Selling skills. Ability to listen actively, ask insightful questions, and uncover the real needs of the client, becoming a trusted partner. Use your knowledge of the industry, competitive environment, and client experiences to identify trends and stay ahead of customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the EMEA Team to Success. You will steer the EMEA team members, who are responsible for coordinating with their Strategic Lead, as well as NAMER and APAC counterparts, towards a common goal. You are responsible for ensuring they hit their revenue targets and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored management approach across different sellers with different levels of experience. You will flex your skills to match what is required for each individual and situation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay connected to the Sr. Directors and Strategic Leads to make sure you are operating with the same expectations, helping your reports with the execution of their broader goals and strategies for the local segments of their accounts. You are a the regional expert on these accounts and thought partner in setting the strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a long term account strategy, with short and medium term execution plans, layering a transactional sales motion with an enterprise mindset and focus. Guide the team to where each one of these selling motions is most appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross functional leaders across Global Customer Success, Sales Development and Product Specialist teams to deliver strong growth across a defined client base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to develop rapport with new people, and to maintain relationships, combined with a positive, outgoing personality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communicator, whether in presentations or casual conversations, and can convey value propositions clearly across all levels of an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to distill and explain complex issues in simple terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to travel to clients on a regular basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are the CEO of your business, managing an EMEA team aligned to our Global Strategic clients, which include firms in public and private markets across the buy and sell side. EMEA will partner with Pod Members in APAC and NAMER to achieve a common goal, driving deals forward and delivering on a shared revenue target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell with your team. You are the Regional Manager, elevating the sales dialogue and strategy with C-Level peers across our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong internal relationships, garnering buy in from those you partner with and marshaling resources to deliver on revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with your team to forecast accurately and develop the necessary pipeline to meet and exceed goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with our marketing team to expand brand awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our Customer Success team to ensure client engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate insights on the EMEA market and client product needs to sales, product management, content, and product marketing to help us continually enhance our products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We love pets - which is why we’re on a mission to make the world a better place for pets and their parents.&amp;nbsp; We offer pet insurance policies with generous pet health benefits that are designed with their needs in mind. We’ve helped half a million pets stay happy and healthy since 2017 - and many more customers throughout the world are joining us every day.&amp;nbsp; Our company is respectful, fun-loving and passionate about pets and their wellbeing.&amp;nbsp; Throughout our business you&#39;ll meet people who think differently, aim for impact, and love to try new things.&amp;nbsp; Want to join our pack?&amp;nbsp; Join us. Love every moment. Love ManyPets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role and purpose mandate&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ManyPets is continuing to evolve as it scales, with increasing organisational complexity and a need for strong People partnership that enables leaders to build high-performing, engaged and effective teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior People Advisor plays a critical role in aligning people priorities with business goals, partnering with senior leaders to shape organisational capability, improve performance, strengthen manager capability and support sustainable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines advisory partnership with practical delivery across organisational effectiveness, employee relations, workforce planning, leadership capability, engagement, wellbeing and data-led decision making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with designated senior leaders and management teams to deliver effective people plans and solutions, ensuring they land well, are embedded within the teams you support, and contribute directly to business performance, employee experience and our values-led culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;A day in the life&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for providing employee relations advise to designated business areas, supporting leaders with organisational design, workforce planning, performance, engagement and complex people matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on support, coaching leaders through ambiguity and ensuring People activity is commercially grounded, legally sound and aligned to company priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support People Advisors, ensuring consistent, high-quality advice and operational delivery across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;People Partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leaders to translate business priorities into clear, practical and measurable people plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide trusted advice on organisational change, leadership effectiveness, team health, engagement, performance and culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use people data, engagement insight and employee relations trends to identify risks, opportunities and areas for action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach leaders to make balanced, inclusive and commercially grounded people decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a values-led People experience is felt by teams and delivered in line with business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Change Management &amp;amp; Engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and lead the People elements of change projects that improve business performance and align with strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leaders and managers to ensure change is understood, communicated effectively and embedded well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support change initiatives including organisational design, redeployment, ways-of-working changes and team restructures, ensuring risks are identified and mitigated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior leaders on timely communication and engagement plans for upcoming change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help managers and teams understand engagement results, identify themes and agree practical actions to improve future engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Employee Relations, Risk &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on complex employee relations matters, ensuring fair, consistent, legally sound and values-led outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on performance, conduct, absence, grievance, disciplinary and change-related matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify people risk and escalate appropriately, balancing employee experience, policy, legal requirements and business need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build manager capability to handle people matters confidently, consistently and with awareness of the impact on individuals, teams and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a proactive focus on wellbeing risks, including mental health, and ensure inclusion and wellbeing principles are considered across the employee journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support positive employee relations, helping to maintain a healthy working environment, morale and regrettable turnover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Data, Reward &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draw insight from people metrics to inform and advise stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data-driven insight to continuously improve people strategies, processes and interventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insight and support on reward processes, including benchmarking where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure people data, reward activity and related processes are accurate, well managed and compliant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain awareness of GDPR, data protection requirements and relevant internal policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support a regulated business environment by balancing innovation, fairness, employee experience and appropriate governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;People Advisor Support &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support People Advisors, providing direction, coaching and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the quality and consistency of advice provided to managers and employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise and allocate casework, ensuring effective workload management and timely resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve people processes, guidance, templates and manager self-service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure People activity is delivered consistently, accurately and in line with policy, employment law and company values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Measures of success&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business leaders receive proactive, commercially grounded and trusted people partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People plans support organisational priorities, performance and capability needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change activity lands well, is clearly communicated and is embedded effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee relations matters are managed fairly, consistently and with appropriate risk mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manager capability improves, particularly in performance, engagement, change and employee relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People risks and wellbeing themes are identified early and addressed pragmatically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People Advisors are well supported, effective and delivering high-quality advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People data and insight are used to inform better decisions and improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthens the connection between business strategy and people priorities, helping leaders build effective teams and make better people decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improves organisational effectiveness, manager capability and employee experience through consistent, high-quality People partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a People Advisor, ideally in a fast-paced, scaling, operational or customer-service-led environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with senior leaders and managers through periods of change, transformation or organisational complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong employee relations expertise and a deep understanding of UK employment law and best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded, delivery-focused and able to balance business priorities with fairness, empathy and sound judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident using people data and insight to diagnose issues, influence decisions and improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with reporting, Excel and larger data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to influence senior stakeholders, challenge constructively and coach leaders effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing, coaching or developing People Advisors or HR colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, high standards of accuracy and a commitment to quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, pragmatic and able to translate complex people matters into clear, practical advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CIPD qualified or able to demonstrate equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated financial services environment is essential, with a good understanding of SM&amp;amp;CR or similar regulatory expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£60,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£70,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Ways of working&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a typical day you’ll be working from a laptop with a screen, mouse, keyboard, and headset.&amp;nbsp; You’ll be meeting your colleagues on Zoom and keeping in touch regularly via email and Slack too – we’d expect you to be using your computer for around seven hours a day.&amp;nbsp; We’d ask that you have a distraction-free work area and a reliable internet connection with a speed of 25Mbps so you can work effectively.&amp;nbsp; We’ll make sure you have the right home set-up that supports you in the role by providing best-in-class technology, money towards a desk, and vision support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion at ManyPets&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We promise to give you the same opportunities as everyone else and we won’t discriminate against you at any point in the process. This includes how we source talent, our interview process, our conditions of employment (including pay) and feedback. &amp;nbsp;If you&#39;d like to read more about this, please download our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/6htm7c3glth8e7x3sm5xe/Our-Approach-to-Inclusion-Policy-ManyPets-May-24.pdf?rlkey=d0fjswa0v1h6r582kn9mubl9j&amp;amp;st=no0ket4o&amp;amp;dl=0&quot;&gt;Approach to Inclusion&lt;/a&gt; policy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Reasonable adjustments and support&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any help, support, or advice at any point during the hiring process please email &lt;a ---------- If you want to ask any questions or request an adjustment, please let us know and we&#39;ll do what we can to flex our approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Connect with us!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/manypets&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.co.uk/Overview/Working-at-ManyPets-EI_IE2165347.11,19.htm&quot;&gt;Glassdoor&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://uk.indeed.com/cmp/Manypets/about&quot;&gt;Indeed&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.feefo.com/en-GB/reviews/bought-by-many?displayFeedbackType=SERVICE&amp;amp;timeFrame=YEAR&quot;&gt;FeeFo&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/boughtbymany.com&quot;&gt;Trustpilot&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ManyPetsUK&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/manypets_UK&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/manypetsuk&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/manypets_uk&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@manypets_UK&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Purpose/Mission - The role owns the infrastructure, network and cybersecurity workstream for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PHENOGY&#39;s corporate IT infrastructure (cloud, network, endpoints, identities and access) and its interfaces with the Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) product environment. It translates business, product, operational, customer and regulatory requirements into secure, resilient and auditable infrastructure and security controls across the BESS lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cybersecurity governance and the Information Security Management System (ISO/IEC 27001)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security architecture of BESS connectivity (EMS, BMS, gateways, IoT, APIs) and secure data exchange with partners such as Heidelberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backup, business continuity and disaster recovery for critical systems (BESS/EMS, ERP, CRM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management of infrastructure and cybersecurity projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Tasks &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as internal-facing and technical owner of the IT infrastructure and security landscape: network, firewalling and web filtering, Microsoft 365/Azure tenants, identity and access management, endpoints, backup, and secure remote/supplier access to BESS sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the asset and configuration inventory, network and security architecture documentation, risk register, vulnerability backlog, security policies and the infrastructure/security roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the risk management and vulnerability management cycle: periodic assessments, prioritisation, patching and remediation tracking across IT systems, applications, APIs and BESS connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and operate security monitoring, incident response, escalation paths, maintenance windows and problem management, together with external service providers (MSP/MSSP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define backup and retention policies (daily, monthly, yearly; 10+ years for critical data), offline/immutable backups, disaster-recovery runbooks and regular restore and DR tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define secure segmentation between corporate IT and the OT/BESS environment and secure remote access for O&amp;amp;M and field service, aligned with IEC 62443 concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide infrastructure, system-integration and cybersecurity support to the After Sales &amp;amp; Service framework once operational responsibility moves to the Service Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support B2B customer and audit requests: security questionnaires, tender requirements and compliance evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on when required: configure firewall rules, endpoint and identity policies, backup jobs and cloud security settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Projects (2027 portfolio)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Management &amp;amp; Vulnerability Assessment (Jan–Feb 2027): assess risks and vulnerabilities across all systems and deliver a prioritised remediation plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BESS Security Architecture II (Jan–Mar 2027): secure the BESS architecture and data exchange with Heidelberg, building on the current BESS security baseline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Continuity &amp;amp; Recovery System (Feb–Apr 2027): offline backup and disaster recovery for critical systems such as BESS/EMS, ERP and CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network Improvements (Feb–Jun 2027): introduce firewalling and web filtering, which are not yet in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Threat Protection – ISO 27001 (Mar–May 2027): protect network and application traffic, including APIs and IP-based access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISO 27001 Enhancements (ongoing): close control gaps, maintain policies and evidence, and prepare for audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take over operation of granular backup and advanced endpoint management, and provide security input to the PHENOGY IoT solution POC (BMS/EMS communication and REST APIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core Competencies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead assigned infrastructure and cybersecurity projects from initiation through closure, using structured scope, schedule, budget, dependency, risk, issue, decision and change control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create project charters, work breakdown structures, delivery plans, security requirements, test and DR-test plans, cutover plans, acceptance records and handover packages to operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate external suppliers (MSP/MSSP, network and firewall vendors, cloud providers, BESS/EMS partners) to resolve cross-functional blockers and escalate material decisions to the Head of IT and relevant governance bodies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide concise status reporting on progress, milestones, risk posture, vulnerabilities, incidents, suppliers and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree or equivalent professional experience in information technology, computer science, information security, engineering or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in IT infrastructure and cybersecurity management, including responsibility for delivering projects, ideally in an international mid-sized company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with network security (firewalls, VPN, segmentation, web filtering, IDS/IPS), Microsoft 365 / Entra ID / Intune / Defender, and backup and disaster recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running risk assessments, vulnerability management and security incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing or maintaining an ISMS according to ISO/IEC 27001.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating technical suppliers and multidisciplinary stakeholders across business, IT and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand operational technology and industrial-system boundaries without assuming ownership of safety engineering or embedded-control design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation, risk management and executive-status reporting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional English; German or another relevant operating language is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strongly preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing Battery Energy Storage Systems, EMS, BMS, SCADA, PLC, PCS/inverters, industrial gateways, IoT or energy-data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of IEC 62443, NIS2 and the EU Cyber Resilience Act in mixed IT/OT environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Azure networking and security, Microsoft Sentinel / Defender XDR and enterprise firewall platforms (e.g. Fortinet, Palo Alto, Check Point).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with industrial protocols and secure integration patterns, including Modbus TCP, OPC UA, MQTT, REST APIs, API gateways and certificate/PKI management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with backup and DR solutions for cloud and hybrid environments, including immutable and offline backups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized credentials such as CISSP, CISM, ISO 27001 Lead Implementer/Auditor, GICSP, PMP, PRINCE2 or ITIL are advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decision-making authority: Approves infrastructure and security changes, firewall and access rules and security exceptions within the agreed policy framework and budget; may isolate systems or accounts during a security incident; escalates risk acceptance and major investments to the Head of IT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting Line: Reporting to Head of IT Direct reports: none (functional lead of external infrastructure and security providers)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workload: 100% - Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel: approx. 10% – PHENOGY offices, BESS customer sites and partner/supplier sites as required&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;For recruitment and staffing agencies: PHENOGY works exclusively with selected recruitment partners under formal agreements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We do not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from agencies and assume no liability for claims made by unauthorized recruiters regarding our recruitment processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced Manager who takes technical ownership how PHENOGY turns technology into system solutions from system strategy and architecture to the engineering that delivers it. You will define which applications we serve with which system solutions: Standard solutions configured from a modular kit of standard components, and application-specific solutions for selected target segments where a business case justifies them. Working closely with CTO, product lifecycle management and the business side, you make sure our engineering resources go where they create the most value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your Tasks &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Develop and own the system strategy: which applications we serve with which system solutions, and which belong to the standard kit or to application-specific solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Define and maintain the modular kit of standard components and reference architectures from which standard solutions are configured.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Evaluate application-specific solutions together with commercial product lifecycle management and the business side, including technical concept, effort, risks, roll-out potential and comparison with alternative scenarios, as input to a clear business case.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Prioritise engineering resources across standard and application-specific solutions to maximise return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own the system architecture and interfaces between subsystems (BMS, PCS, EMS, thermal management, fire safety) and the system behaviour across hardware and software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own the structure of the verification and validation plan and decide which supplier evidence is sufficient for bought-in components.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead and develop the system engineering team, and steer technical partners and suppliers on system questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Assess the system-wide impact of changes and run technical change decisions in line with our ISO processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Must have’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Degree in electrical engineering, power electronics, mechatronics, systems engineering or a comparable field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
