&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Director Tax, you will lead the Group Tax Department, overseeing all group-wide tax matters and a team of four professionals. This is a strategic yet hands-on role where you will develop group-wide tax optimization opportunities, lead tax audits, and continuously evolve the group tax and transfer pricing strategy. You will be part of the Group Finance Leadership Team, working closely with the CFO and company leadership to ensure tax compliance and support special projects.&lt;/p&gt;
