&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our software program comprises several teams around R&amp;amp;D on both Command&amp;amp;Control (C2) and Autonomy functions as well as Delivery and Operations capabilities. Every unmanned system in the STARK portfolio relies on this single, rapidly evolving, reliable, and intelligent software program. Our teams are distributed across several locations in Europe and Ukraine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Software Trainer for Minerva, you are the crucial link between STARK’s cutting-edge C2 software and the operators who deploy it in the field. You will ensure that internal and external personnel - especially military operators - can master our central control suite for all unmanned systems, operating it flawlessly under pressure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and conduct comprehensive software-related training for internal and external personnel, with a heavy focus on military end-users operating our systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master the simulation environment, operating it independently, running challenging and engaging trainings in preparation of real flight operations for missions domestically and internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather actionable feedback directly from military users regarding software functionalities and user workflows, feeding this critical intelligence back to our engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine our training methodologies, adapting them to new technologies and evolving situations, while acting as a passionate advocate for our software and simulation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in technical training, software instruction, or user onboarding, ideally within complex, high-stakes, or mission-critical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience operating, troubleshooting, and teaching within simulation environments or advanced software suites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically adept, with a strong ability to understand complex C2 software architectures and quickly learn new simulation interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crisp communicator who effortlessly distills complex technical and strategic contexts into simple, compelling written and spoken communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in military service and especially in the Cyber / IT domain is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with simulation engines such as Virtual Battlespace 4 (VBS4).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with modern tools like Jira, Confluence, and advanced planning/reporting platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
