&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Investigate and resolve engineering challenges related to simulation performance and model fidelity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
