&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;ABOUT THE JOB:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are on the lookout for an exceptional Senior International Accounting Manager to lead Anduril’s accounting operations across Continental Europe and the Middle East from our Amsterdam office. This role owns the month-end close, statutory reporting, audit deliverables, and accounting operations for the Company’s legal entities throughout the region, and is the senior accounting leader on the ground as that footprint expands.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will stand up and scale the accounting function while partnering with Legal, Tax, Treasury, Payroll, and Operations as each new jurisdiction comes online. This is a leadership seat: you will hire, develop, and lead the accounting team in Amsterdam, and manage the outsourced providers supporting the countries where we do not yet have our own people.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The ideal candidate has run a multi-country close, is fluent in the difference between a US GAAP reporting package and a local statutory filing, and would rather design the process than inherit it. Join us in our mission to disrupt the defense industry and elevate your career with a team dedicated to making a significant impact on a global scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the month-end, quarter-end, and year-end close for the Company’s legal entities across Continental Europe and the Middle East, delivering to internal deadlines while ensuring the accuracy of financial data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own statutory reporting across the region, including statutory financial statements, local reporting differences, and adherence to local filing deadlines in each jurisdiction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage local statutory audits end to end, acting as the primary point of contact for local auditors while coordinating with the HQ team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review journal entries, account reconciliations, and fluctuation analyses; validate foreign currency remeasurement and translation impacts for the region’s entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own accounts payable operations and the procure-to-pay cycle for the region, from invoice receipt through payment disbursement, including vendor relationship management and payment performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop, and lead the regional accounting team in Amsterdam - including accounting managers and specialists - as the Company grows throughout the region, and manage outsourced accounting providers where local work is performed externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary accounting liaison between the US parent company and the&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the accounting workstream on new entity and country launches, partnering with Legal on incorporation and registration and with Business Operations on site readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to internal controls and accounting policies, and design and document new controls as entities and requirements come online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Tax, Treasury, and Payroll on VAT and local tax filings, transfer pricing support, intercompany settlement, cash forecasting, and payroll approvals across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the configuration and ongoing maintenance of the region’s legal entities within the Company’s ERP, including any local statutory reporting basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and execute opportunities for process improvement, including the adoption of automation and AI tools, so that the function scales faster than its headcount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional operational and program leaders to support business decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on ad-hoc projects with accounting and finance teams across the Company, from leases and fixed assets to inventory, intercompany, and tax provision support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHO YOU ARE:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of progressive accounting experience, including 5+ years in a supervisory or management role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning the close and statutory deliverables for multiple legal entities in more than one country.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading an accounting team across more than one country, including the development of other managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a global organization reporting to a US parent; public accounting experience a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RA, ACA, ACCA, CPA, or equivalent certification preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of US GAAP and IFRS, with practical experience in local statutory reporting requirements across European jurisdictions; Middle East exposure a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing local statutory audits and external accounting or audit providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel skills and proficiency with ERP systems (Oracle Fusion Cloud preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership, team management, and interpersonal skills, with a track record of hiring and developing accountants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and project management skills, with the ability to keep multiple jurisdictions and workstreams on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable building process where little exists today, with a proven ability to manage competing priorities in a high growth organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with a mindset for continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to work effectively with colleagues across time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English; additional European languages a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office Suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an ----- address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is ----- before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
Server Infrastructure is a Site Reliability Engineering (SRE) team responsible for the full lifecycle of Nebius Cloud hardware: from newly delivered bare metal through provisioning, operation, maintenance, and decommissioning. Almost every Nebius service runs on servers within our domain. Our mission is to make the hardware layer fast, reliable, and invisible.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We apply software engineering to infrastructure operations. We build services and automation that bring servers into the cloud, keep them healthy, recover them from failures, and retire them safely. Our work spans CPU and GPU platforms, the base GNU/Linux system, and the infrastructure supporting our hardware fleet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Senior / Staff Engineer, you’ll take ownership of complex infrastructure challenges and help shape the team’s technical direction. You’ll combine hands-on engineering with architecture, mentoring, and coordination across teams, turning operational needs into reliable services and automation.&lt;br&gt;You’ll work closely with data center engineers, capacity managers, cloud compute developers, networking teams, and hardware suppliers. Your work will directly affect the reliability and capacity of the entire cloud platform.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Y&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;our responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and operate services for netboot, provisioning, maintenance, automated recovery, and decommissioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical initiatives from problem definition and design through implementation and production operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the technical roadmap, balancing reliability improvements, new hardware integration, and long-term engineering work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define meaningful reliability indicators and service level objectives, using them to guide engineering priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce operational toil by turning recurring failures and manual procedures into reliable automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve on-call practices, incident response, and learning through blameless incident reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen fleet observability, alerting, testing, deployment safety, and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive support for new CPU and GPU platforms and improvements to the base GNU/Linux system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers, provide thoughtful design and code reviews, and help the team develop sound engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate delivery across teams, communicate technical tradeoffs, and resolve dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering experience in Go and a solid understanding of Linux systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, building, and operating infrastructure services, including distributed systems and failure handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning complex technical initiatives and bringing them into production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of SRE principles: service level objectives, observability, incident management, capacity planning, and toil reduction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound technical judgment and the ability to guide architecture and investigate difficult production problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring engineers and improving engineering practices through collaboration and technical example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and the ability to work effectively across engineering and operational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;We welcome candidates at senior and staff levels. The scope of ownership and technical influence will reflect your experience.&lt;br&gt;Experience with hardware provisioning, &lt;strong&gt;bare metal infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;GPU platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, or large server fleets would be valuable.&lt;br&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes, infrastructure as code, GitOps, SaltStack, and Terraform&lt;/strong&gt; is also useful.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We conduct coding interviews as part of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;The-Role&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;913&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;923&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Senior Site Reliability Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;to join the team building and operating &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Nebius Data Platform &lt;/strong&gt;— a distributed storage and a processing platform that acts as the company’s “source of truth” and the backbone of many internal (and some external) products.&lt;br&gt;Nebius Data Platform is a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;single multi-tenant ecosystem based on YTsaurus&lt;/strong&gt; — instead of running separate HDFS/Kafka/HBase-style systems, we provide storage, compute, and analytics capabilities inside one platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;923&quot;&gt;We operate across data centers worldwide, running YTsaurus in dedicated Kubernetes clusters with Kubernetes operators and supporting services written primarily in Go. We maintain our own Nebius distribution, develop functionality across the core and platform services, and contribute upstream where it makes sense. This gives us the ability to take improvements from design through implementation to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;923&quot;&gt;At scale today, this includes&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;~500 servers, ~20k CPU cores&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;~10 PB of compressed&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;data&lt;/strong&gt; in our largest production cluster, supporting workloads ranging from business-critical pipelines and financial transactions to large-scale ML/LLM training datasets and compute.&lt;br&gt;As an SRE, you’ll combine software engineering with production ownership: understand how the platform behaves, identify what limits its reliability and growth, and build lasting improvements alongside the developers and teams who use it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2365&quot;&gt;Own and improve the reliability, performance, and capacity of our YTsaurus clusters, with particular attention to data durability and predictable behavior under load.&lt;/p&gt;
